        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock Rectangular Woodward Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary styled Woodward Deadbolt is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-elegance-collection\"><b>Weslock Elegance Collection</b></a> and features a rectangular rose. It has a five pin lock cylinder and a heavy duty security strike with 3 inch screws. It is available as a Single Cylinder (key operated from outside, thumb turn operated from the inside).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Weslock Traditional Woodward Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Heavy duty security strike with 3\" long screws.</li>\r\n<li>5 pin lock cylinder.</li>\r\n<li>1\" throw deadbolt with two hardened steel rollers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Limited Lifetime Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Weslock Traditional Woodward Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Height: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits doors prepared with 2-1/8\" or 1-5/8\" cross bore hole and 1\" edge hole</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable from1-3/8\" to 2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: adjustable latches for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" with removable faceplate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
