                "description": "Weslock Contemporary Woodward Deadbolt - This contemporary Woodward Deadbolt is from the Weslock Elegance Collection and features a rectangular rose. It has a five pin lock cylinder and a heavy duty security strike with 3 inch screws. It is available as a Single Cylinder (key operated from outside, thumb turn operated from the inside).",
